@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Rejestracja nowego konta
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Anna", "email": "anna@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

### 1b. Logowanie
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "anna@test.pl", "password": "haslo1234" }

### 2. Moje portfele (po rejestracji: jeden "Mój portfel", role OWNER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Nowy portfel, oczekiwane 201
# @name createWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie" }

### 4. Jeden portfel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 5. Zmiana nazwy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie Krakowska 12" }

### 6. Pusta nazwa, oczekiwane 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 7. Usunięcie, oczekiwane 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Ten sam portfel po usunięciu, oczekiwane 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 9. Bez tokena, oczekiwane 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets

### 10. Ustawienie limitu i progu (PUT podmienia wszystkie pola: name + limit)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie", "monthlyLimit": 2500.00, "warningThreshold": 80 }

### 11. Usunięcie limitu (próg też zostaje wyzerowany)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie", "monthlyLimit": null, "warningThreshold": null }

### 12. Ujemny limit i próg > 100, oczekiwane 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{createWallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mieszkanie", "monthlyLimit": -5, "warningThreshold": 150 }
